		<P CLASS="ParaOverride-7" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-indent:-24pt;widows:2;margin-top:8pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">II.<FONT STYLE="width: 17px;display: inline-block;">&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;</FONT></FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">It is resolved as a special resolution that, subject to and immediately following the Share Consolidation being effected, the Company adopt an amended and restated memorandum of association in substitution for, and to the exclusion of, the Company&#x2019;s then existing memorandum of association, to reflect the Share Consolidation (the &#x201c;Amendment and Restatement of the MoA&#x201d;)</FONT></P>
